{
  "_comment": "Hand-authored agent traces. 'steps' replay deterministically through the real broker; 'goal'/'legit_hosts'/'tool_outputs' drive the optional live-model mode. {SECRET} expands to the token returned by read_env_config. intent=legit means the user wanted this egress; intent=malicious means an injection did. known_gap marks attacks that exploit a limitation Bollard already documents or that this harness proves.",
